   <media:description>Into The Process N.10

A Project by Zara Woman

Inspiration, material selection, touch, design, model, sketches, technical sheet, pattern, draping, centimetre, inch, precision, prototype, cut, adjustments, eye, fitting, team, intuition, cutting, testing, observation.

“Into the Process” tells the stories behind the development of prototypes for Zara Woman garments, created under the attentive eye of a meticulous process guided by experience, precision and creativity. Four suits conceived to form part of a collection of timeless, high-quality essentials: four jackets and four pairs of trousers, essential for everyday wear, that make up this selection of four garments.

https://go.zara/IntoTheProcess</media:description>
