   <media:thumbnail url="https://i3.ytimg.com/vi/2F69CW4z-L8/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>ZARA SRPLS finds new possibilities for self-expression in the familiar vocabulary of everyday dressing. The season’s collections for women, men and children explore the power of proportion, texture, colour and detail to lend familiar clothes unexpected character. 

Utility remains the foundation of the SRPLS wardrobe, while its expression continues to evolve. Recognisable archetypes are reworked through inventive material treatments, nuanced silhouettes and combinations that partner polish with practicality. The result is a wardrobe that offers coherence without imposing sameness: these are clothes whose ultimate character is determined by the individual wearing them.

Creative Director: Karl Templer
Photographer: Craig McDean 
Video: Ned Rogers 
Styling: Karl Templer 
Make up: Diane Kendal 
Hair: Duffy 
Set Designer: Gainsbury&amp;Whiting 
Casting Director: Piergiorgio 
Production: Gainsbury&amp;Whiting

Woman collection https://go.zara/SRPLS-W-y
Man collection https://go.zara/SRPLS-M-y
Kids collection https://go.zara/SRPLS-K-y</media:description>
